                        "type":  "background",
                        "data":  {
                                     "identifier":  "charlatan",
                                     "description":  "You live by scams and misdirection, gaining proficiency in Deception and Sleight of Hand plus a disguise kit and a forgery kit. You start with elegant clothing, a disguise set, trick accessories, and a coin purse. Feature: False Identity â€” you maintain a second believable persona with forged papers and established contacts that holds up under routine inspection.",
