                    {
                        "id":  "bg-sage-0002-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
                        "name":  "Sage",
                        "type":  "background",
                        "data":  {
                                     "identifier":  "sage",
                                     "description":  "Devoted to study, you gain proficiency in Arcana and History, plus two additional languages of your choice. You begin with writing supplies including ink, quill and a small blade, an unsolved letter from a late peer, everyday clothes and a small purse of gold. Your Researcher feature means you generally know which library, archive or scholar could hold obscure lore you seek.",
                                     "weight":  0,
