                    {
                        "id":  "bg-urchin-0004-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
                        "name":  "Urchin",
                        "type":  "background",
                        "data":  {
                                     "identifier":  "urchin",
                                     "description":  "Grown up on the streets, you gain proficiency in Sleight of Hand and Stealth, plus a disguise kit and thieves\u0027 tools. You start with a small blade, a hand-drawn map of your home city, a pet mouse, a sentimental keepsake, plain clothes and a small purse of gold. Your City Secrets feature lets you move through urban areas twice as fast as others when you are not being pursued.",
